@startuml
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
left to right direction

actor "BIM coordinator / Designer" as User
component "ContextFilter.UI\nWPF / ViewModels" as UI
component "ContextFilter.Application\nUse Cases / Services" as App
component "ContextFilter.Domain\nModels / Semantics" as Domain
component "ContextFilter.Infrastructure\nJSON Persistence / Logging" as Infra
component "ContextFilter.Revit\nAdd-in / ExternalEvent / Revit API" as RevitPlugin
component "Autodesk Revit 2025\nDocument / View / Elements / Selection" as RevitHost

User --> UI : filter intent / actions
UI --> App : use cases
UI --> Domain : domain models
App --> Domain : semantic models
Infra --> App : ports / persistence
Infra --> Domain : persisted models
RevitPlugin --> UI : host integration
RevitPlugin --> Infra
RevitPlugin --> App
RevitPlugin --> Domain
RevitPlugin --> RevitHost : collect / transaction / native actions
RevitHost --> RevitPlugin : document state / events

note right of Domain
No Revit/WPF/persistence dependency
end note

note bottom of RevitHost
Authority for document,
elements, views, selection
and native API state
end note
@enduml
